{"type":"message","id":"07d14f4d","parentId":"7b3a93cf","timestamp":"2026-01-31T06:30:40.228Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I see the issue! Looking at the logs:\n\n```\nCUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES:1\n```\n\nOllama is configured to only see GPU 1, not all 4 GPUs! That's the problem. It's only detecting one GPU:\n\n```\n\"inference compute\" id=GPU-80057020-1dd2-11b2-a95c-865aa58fb7fa ... name=CUDA0 description=\"GRID A100DX-80C\" ... total=\"80.0 GiB\" available=\"74.2 GiB\"\n```\n\nOnly one GPU is being detected. But the model is 42GB and should fit on one 80GB GPU... so maybe the issue is something else.\n\nLet me check the Ollama environment configuration and see if we need to expose all GPUs.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Da ist das Problem! 🤖\n\nIn den Logs sehe ich:\n\n```\nCUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES:1\n```\n\n**Ollama sieht nur GPU 1**, nicht alle vier. Das muss in der Service-Konfiguration geändert werden."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_019FdvH3dBmNm9Qs7TEG2MXg","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep -r \"CUDA_VISIBLE\" /etc/systemd/system/ollama* /etc/default/ollama* /etc/environment 2>/dev/null; cat /etc/systemd/system/ollama.service.d/*.conf 2>/dev/null"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01JzPVNoDWxmTgJTR8syLGCZ","name":"process","arguments":{"action":"kill","sessionId":"nova-haven"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-opus-4-5","usage":{"input":8,"output":429,"cacheRead":31547,"cacheWrite":4964,"totalTokens":36948,"cost":{"input":0.00004,"output":0.010725,"cacheRead":0.0157735,"cacheWrite":0.031025,"total":0.057563500000000004}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1769841031507}}
