{"type":"message","id":"f829aa4b","parentId":"fa4d4a52","timestamp":"2026-01-31T06:30:52.115Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Found it! There's an override config that limits Ollama to only GPU 1. We need to change this to allow all GPUs.\n\nFor multi-GPU support with Ollama, we have a few options:\n\n1. Remove `CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES` entirely - Ollama will see all GPUs and automatically spread models that need more VRAM across multiple GPUs\n\n2. Set `CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0,1,2,3` to explicitly allow all 4 GPUs\n\nLet me also check if there's any issue with the vGPU setup for multi-GPU - sometimes GRID vGPUs don't support peer-to-peer access which is needed for tensor parallelism.\n\nLet me show Daniel what's happening and suggest the fix.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Gefunden! In `/etc/systemd/system/ollama.service.d/override.conf`:\n\n```\nEnvironment=\"CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=1\"\n```\n\nOllama ist auf **nur eine GPU** beschränkt. Für nemotron:70b (~42 GB Modell + KV-Cache) reicht eine 80GB A100 theoretisch, aber mit Overhead wird's knapp.\n\n**Lösung — alle 4 GPUs freigeben:**\n\n```bash\n# Override anpassen\nsudo nano /etc/systemd/system/ollama.service.d/override.conf\n```\n\nÄndern zu:\n```ini\n[Service]\nEnvironment=\"OLLAMA_HOST=0.0.0.0:11434\"\nEnvironment=\"CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0,1,2,3\"\n```\n\nDann:\n```bash\nsudo systemctl daemon-reload\nsudo systemctl restart ollama\n```\n\n**Aber:** Da ihr GRID vGPUs habt (virtualisiert), könnte Multi-GPU problematisch sein — NVLink/Peer-to-Peer funktioniert oft nicht zwischen vGPUs.\n\nSoll ich die Änderung vornehmen und testen? Oder willst du erst prüfen, ob Multi-GPU bei eurer vGPU-Konfiguration überhaupt supported ist?"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-opus-4-5","usage":{"input":8,"output":516,"cacheRead":36511,"cacheWrite":565,"totalTokens":37600,"cost":{"input":0.00004,"output":0.0129,"cacheRead":0.0182555,"cacheWrite":0.00353125,"total":0.03472675}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1769841040239}}
